@startuml
title Healthcare Portal - User Registration and Login State Machine Diagram

state PortalChoice1 <<choice>>
state PortalChoice2 <<choice>>
state PortalChoice3 <<choice>>
state ServiceJoin <<choice>>
state OwnerJoin <<choice>>
state RegistrationFailure <<choice>>
state SignInSuccess <<choice>>
state FacilityAccess <<choice>>
state NewsContentReading <<choice>>
state HealthCheckup <<choice>>
state PaymentSelection <<choice>>
state CashPaymentDetails <<choice>>
state InsurancePaymentCompletion <<choice>>
state FeedbackCollection <<choice>>
state Logout

[*] --> PortalChoice1

PortalChoice1 --> PortalChoice2 : [Healthcare Service Center Portal]
PortalChoice1 --> PortalChoice3 : [Patient Portal]

PortalChoice2 --> ServiceCenterRegistration : [New Healthcare Service Center]
PortalChoice2 --> RegistrationFailure : [Registration Fails]
PortalChoice3 --> CarOwnerRegistration : [New Patient]
PortalChoice3 --> OwnerJoin : [Registered Patient]

state "Healthcare Service Center Registration" as ServiceCenterRegistration
ServiceCenterRegistration : entry / Unregistered healthcare service center
ServiceCenterRegistration : do / Enter Valid Credentials
ServiceCenterRegistration : exit / Account registered

state "Healthcare Service Center Verification" as ServiceCenterVerification
ServiceCenterVerification : entry / Healthcare service center account registered
ServiceCenterVerification : do / Verify Healthcare service center
ServiceCenterVerification : exit / Login Healthcare service center

state "Healthcare Service Center Login" as ServiceCenterLogin
ServiceCenterLogin : entry / Verified Healthcare Service Center
ServiceCenterLogin : entry / Healthcare Service Center not logged in
ServiceCenterLogin : do / Authenticate Healthcare Service Center
ServiceCenterLogin : exit / Logged In Successfully

state "Healthcare service center Home" as ServiceCenterHome
ServiceCenterHome : entry / Logged in Healthcare Service Center
ServiceCenterHome : do / Display home page
ServiceCenterHome : exit / Enter Facility Access
ServiceCenterHome : exit / Read News and Expert Content
ServiceCenterHome : exit / Check Symptoms or Use Fitness Checking Options
ServiceCenterHome : exit / Logout

state "Entering Facility Access" as FacilityAccess
FacilityAccess : entry / To enter Facility Access
FacilityAccess : do / Preparing and entering facility access
FacilityAccess : exit / Return to Healthcare service center home page

state "Logout" as Logout
Logout : entry / To Logout
Logout : do / Logout
Logout : exit / Logged out Successfully

ServiceCenterRegistration --> ServiceCenterVerification : [Registration Success]
ServiceCenterVerification --> ServiceCenterLogin : [Login Success]
ServiceCenterLogin --> ServiceCenterHome : [Login Successful]
ServiceCenterHome --> RegistrationFailure : [Registration Fails]
ServiceCenterHome --> FacilityAccess : [Enter Facility Access]
ServiceCenterHome --> NewsContentReading : [Read News and Expert Content]
ServiceCenterHome --> HealthCheckup : [Check Symptoms or Use Fitness Checking Options]
ServiceCenterHome --> PaymentSelection : [Select Payment Method]
ServiceCenterHome --> CashPaymentDetails : [Cash Payment Details]
ServiceCenterHome --> InsurancePaymentCompletion : [Insurance Payment Completion]
ServiceCenterHome --> FeedbackCollection : [Collect User Feedback]
RegistrationFailure --> PortalChoice1 : [Retry Registration or Exit]
OwnerJoin --> SignInSuccess : [Sign In Successful]
SignInSuccess --> FacilityAccess : [Enter Facility Access]
SignInSuccess --> NewsContentReading : [Read News and Expert Content]
SignInSuccess --> HealthCheckup : [Check Symptoms or Use Fitness Checking Options]
SignInSuccess --> PaymentSelection : [Select Payment Method]
SignInSuccess --> CashPaymentDetails : [Cash Payment Details]
SignInSuccess --> InsurancePaymentCompletion : [Insurance Payment Completion]
SignInSuccess --> FeedbackCollection : [Collect User Feedback]
SignInSuccess --> Logout : [Logout]
@enduml
